<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f6fa" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#08090d" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<title>酷~一起去看发布会！ | 荣耀Magic9系列现场招募</title>
<style>
/* ============================================================
   主题变量 · 浅色优先 + 系统级深色模式
   浅色：白/浅灰底 + teal 强调；深色：沿用黑银沉浸变量
   ============================================================ */
:root {
  color-scheme: light dark;

  /* 背景（浅色默认） */
  --page-bg: #f5f6fa;
  --page-glow-1: rgba(63, 224, 198, 0.12);   /* 右上 teal */
  --page-glow-2: rgba(31, 184, 156, 0.08);   /* 左下 teal 深 */

  /* 卡片 · 白玻璃 */
  --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
  --card-bg-solid: #ffffff;
  --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
  --card-border-dark: rgba(20, 40, 90, 0.08);

  /* 文字（浅色默认） */
  --text-primary: #10152b;
  --text-secondary: #46506b;
  --text-muted: #7c869e;

  /* 主色：teal 青 */
  --accent: #3fe0c6;
  --accent-strong: #1fb89c;   /* 浅底上的强调文字（深 teal） */
  --accent-soft: rgba(63, 224, 198, 0.14);
  --accent-light: rgba(63, 224, 198, 0.08);
  --accent-2: #3fe0c6;        /* focus 可见环 */
  --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #1fb89c 0%, #12a68b 100%);        /* solid 元素底 */
  --gradient-text: linear-gradient(135deg, #1fb89c 0%, #12a68b 100%);   /* 文字渐变(浅色下用深 teal) */

  /* 阴影 & 圆角 */
  --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(30, 60, 130, 0.08);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 28px rgba(30, 60, 130, 0.16);
  --glow-btn: rgba(31, 184, 156, 0.35);
  --radius: 20px;
  --radius-sm: 14px;
}

/* ============================================================
   深色模式：系统级切换，沿用黑银沉浸变量
   ============================================================ */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;

    /* 背景 */
    --page-bg: #08090d;
    --page-glow-1: rgba(64, 225, 201, 0.10);
    --page-glow-2: rgba(200, 210, 225, 0.05);

    /* 卡片 · 低透明玻璃 */
    --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    --card-bg-solid: #12141a;
    --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    --card-border-dark: transparent;

    /* 文字 · 银灰层次 */
    --text-primary: #f1f2f6;
    --text-secondary: #b2b6c0;
    --text-muted: #707682;

    /* 主色：teal 青 */
    --accent: #3fe0c6;
    --accent-strong: #7df0dc;   /* 深底上的强调文字（亮 teal） */
    --accent-soft: rgba(63, 224, 198, 0.14);
    --accent-light: rgba(63, 224, 198, 0.08);
    --accent-2: #3fe0c6;
    --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #1fb89c 0%, #12a68b 100%);
    --gradient-text: linear-gradient(135deg, #47e4ca 0%, #a8f7e8 100%);

    /* 阴影 & 圆角 */
    --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    --shadow-lg: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
    --glow-btn: rgba(242, 244, 248, 0.28);
  }
}

/* ============================================================
   基础
   ============================================================ */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

html {
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  min-height: 100dvh;
  overflow-x: clip;
  background: var(--page-bg);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "Helvetica Neue",
    "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.7;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

/* 背景光晕（固定定位，不产生滚动空间） */
body::before,
body::after {
  content: '';
  position: fixed;
  border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}
body::before {
  top: -140px; right: -100px;
  width: 340px; height: 340px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--page-glow-1) 0%, transparent 70%);
}
body::after {
  bottom: -120px; left: -100px;
  width: 320px; height: 320px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--page-glow-2) 0%, transparent 70%);
}

/* 页面容器 */
.container {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 768px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 16px;
  padding-left: calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-left));
  padding-right: calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-right));
}

/* ============================================================
   Banner（主视觉 KV，素材 1280x576）
   换图：替换 assets/banner.jpg，同步更新 img 的 width/height
   如需更高清源图可给 <source srcset="assets/banner@2x.jpg 2x">
   ============================================================ */
.banner {
  position: relative;
  margin: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 0 0; /* 覆盖 figure 默认 margin */
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  background: var(--page-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
}
.banner img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

/* ============================================================
   主标题区（视觉口号）
   ============================================================ */
.hero {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 22px 0 4px;
}
.hero h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(24px, 6.5vw, 32px);
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}
.hero h1 .hl {
  background: var(--gradient-text);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  color: transparent;
}
.hero .hero-lead {
  max-width: 30em;
  margin: 12px auto 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

/* ============================================================
   信息条 Info Chips
   ============================================================ */
.info-strip {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}
.info-chip {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  background: var(--card-bg);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: 14px 8px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}
.info-chip .icon { font-size: 22px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.info-chip .label {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.info-chip .value {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-top: 3px;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.info-chip .value.placeholder { color: var(--accent-strong); }

/* ============================================================
   通用卡片
   ============================================================ */
.card {
  background:
    radial-gradient(140% 130% at 100% 0%, var(--accent-soft) 0%, transparent 60%),
    var(--card-bg);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 22px 20px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  margin-top: 14px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.section-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.section-title .t-emoji { font-size: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.card p { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

/* 段落正文 */
.para {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.para:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.para-gap { margin-top: 14px; }
.para strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700; }
.para .quote {
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ============================================================
   主题亮点（圆点列表）
   ============================================================ */
.item-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 4px 0 0;
  padding: 0;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.item-list li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 24px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.85;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.item-list li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.item-list li::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 3px; top: 12px;
  width: 9px; height: 9px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--gradient);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(63, 224, 198, 0.35);
}
.item-list li strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700; }

/* 招募画像 · 3 个胶囊块 */
.who-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 10px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  margin-top: 6px;
}
.who-item {
  background: var(--accent-light);
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: 16px 10px;
  text-align: center;
}
.who-item .w-icon { font-size: 26px; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.who-item .w-text { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.55; }

/* ============================================================
   CTA
   ============================================================ */
.cta-zone {
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 24px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--card-bg);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}
/* CTA 按钮：浅色用渐变，深色用 ARRI 白 */
.cta-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 16px;
  background: var(--gradient);
  color: #ffffff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-align: center;
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--glow-btn);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, filter 0.2s ease;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  cursor: pointer;
  min-height: 52px;
}
.cta-btn::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 0%, transparent 60%);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
}
@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
  .cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 26px var(--glow-btn);
  }
  .cta-btn:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .cta-btn {
    background: #f2f4f8;
    color: #0b0d12;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }
  .cta-btn::before {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75) 0%, transparent 55%);
  }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .cta-btn:hover {
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }
    .cta-btn:hover::before { opacity: 0.4; }
  }
}
.cta-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98) translateY(0); }
.cta-btn:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--accent-2);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* ============================================================
   报名须知（有序列表 1/2/3）
   ============================================================ */
.rules-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin: 0 0 6px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.rules-note {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.rules-list {
  list-style: none;
  counter-reset: rule;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.rules-list li {
  counter-increment: rule;
  position: relative;
  padding: 4px 0 4px 34px;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.85;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.rules-list li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.rules-list li::before {
  content: counter(rule);
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; top: 6px;
  width: 22px; height: 22px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--gradient);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.rules-list li strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700; }

/* ============================================================
   结尾
   ============================================================ */
.outro {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px 16px calc(40px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.outro p {
  margin: 0 auto;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  max-width: 24em;
}
.outro .outro-brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

/* ============================================================
   响应式
   ============================================================ */
/* ≤360px 小屏：卡片内边距收窄，who 三块仍保持可读 */
@media (max-width: 360px) {
  .container { padding-left: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-left)); padding-right: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-right)); }
  .card { padding: 18px 16px; }
  .info-chip .value { font-size: 13px; }
}

/* ≤400px：招募画像降为单列横条，保证 7 字文案可读 */
@media (max-width: 400px) {
  .who-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .who-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .who-item .w-icon { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 0; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .who-item .w-text { font-size: 13.5px; }
}

/* 动效：尊重系统减弱动画设置 */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    transition: none !important;
    animation: none !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="container">

  <!-- ============================================================
       Banner · 主视觉 KV（assets/banner.jpg · 1280x576）
       ============================================================ -->
  <figure class="banner">
    <img src="//image.coolapk.com/image/2026/0909/10/fe8fbc21b49158d0b7420b5a24b1a707-0-o_1k220br335qedfg8j1ec4poia-uid-408649@1080x240.jpg" width="1080" height="240"
         alt="荣耀Magic9系列发布会招募 · 荣耀Magic9系列 一起去看发布会"
         fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  </figure>

  <!-- ============================================================
       信息条 · 占位符 XXX 待主办方填充
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="info-strip" aria-label="活动信息">
    <div class="info-chip">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📍</span>
      <div class="label">地点</div>
      <div class="value">北京</div>
    </div>
    <div class="info-chip">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📅</span>
      <div class="label">时间</div>
      <div class="value">9月28日</div>
    </div>
    <div class="info-chip">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">👥</span>
      <div class="label">名额</div>
      <div class="value">8 人</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       活动内容
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="sec-about">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="sec-about"><span class="t-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🎉</span>活动内容</h2>
    <p class="para">这次我们想找一群<span class="quote">真正喜欢数码产品</span>的朋友，一起去看<strong>荣耀Magic9系列发布会</strong>、看新品、聊配置、聊设计，也聊聊哪些升级是真有东西，哪些只是“发布会传统艺能”。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       招募画像
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="sec-who">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="sec-who"><span class="t-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🙋</span>想找这样的你</h2>
    <p class="para">不用是专业媒体，也不用参数倒背如流。只要你平时看到新机发布会会忍不住点进去，看见新品会想上手摸两下，愿意和大家分享自己的真实想法，就来报名吧。</p>
    <p class="para para-gap"><strong>荣耀Magic9系列</strong>是主角，但我们也想见见屏幕另一边的你。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       报名 CTA（href 占位，替换真实报名链接）
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="cta-zone" aria-label="报名入口">
    <a class="cta-btn" href="https://wj.qq.com/s2/27799783/626x/" id="signup-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span aria-hidden="true">🎟️</span> 点击报名
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       报名须知
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="card" aria-labelledby="sec-rules">
    <h2 class="rules-title" id="sec-rules">📋 报名须知</h2>
    <p class="rules-note">提交报名即视为阅读并同意以下须知：</p>
    <ol class="rules-list">
      <li>由于名额有限，<strong>招募与筛选同步进行</strong>，招募人满即止</li>
      <li>本次活动酷安将<strong>报销来往交通住宿费用</strong>，但用户需自行规划出行</li>
      <li>通过活动报名审核的酷友，将收到工作人员的联系，如临时无法参与活动，请<strong>提前 1 天联系工作人员</strong></li>
      <li>通过报名审核且确认参加活动的用户凭<strong>相关证件、手机号码</strong>，签到进场</li>
      <li>活动过程请注意<strong>人身财产安全</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       结尾 · 口号
       ============================================================ -->
  <footer class="outro">
    <p>隔着屏幕看直播当然可以，<br>和同好一起在现场，感觉真的不一样。</p>
    <div class="outro-brand"><span aria-hidden="true">⚡</span> 酷~一起去看发布会!</div>
  </footer></main>
</body>
  </html>
